294
00:21:07,550 --> 00:21:08,680
My name is Tian Xindi!

295
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:09,550
My name is Li Xinru!

296
00:21:09,550 --> 00:21:10,400
My name is Yang Letong!

297
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:11,510
My name is Wang Shixian!

298
00:21:11,510 --> 00:21:12,440
My name is Wang Yilu!

299
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:13,350
My name is Wang Xinfei!

300
00:21:13,350 --> 00:21:14,110
My name is Yang Hui!

301
00:21:14,110 --> 00:21:14,920
Slander!

302
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:16,510
It's all slander!

303
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:19,070
A bunch of nobodies making up stories

304
00:21:19,440 --> 00:21:21,350
