305
00:21:21,590 --> 00:21:22,680
They are animals!

306
00:21:23,350 --> 00:21:24,920
Kill them!

307
00:21:24,940 --> 00:21:25,880
Kill them!

308
00:21:26,420 --> 00:21:29,280
♪ No longer able to break free ♪

309
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:33,740
