311
00:21:37,490 --> 00:21:40,610
♪ The cruel jests of fate ♪

312
00:21:42,410 --> 00:21:44,800
♪ Now I know to appreciate ♪

313
00:21:45,740 --> 00:21:48,490
♪ The calm as it shatters ♪

314
00:21:49,980 --> 00:21:52,990
♪ No longer craving ♪

315
00:21:53,010 --> 00:21:56,940
♪ Absolution from the heavens ♪

316
00:21:57,680 --> 00:21:57,960
Move.

317
00:21:57,960 --> 00:21:58,720
