350
00:23:20,550 --> 00:23:21,960
studying in a classroom

351
00:23:22,480 --> 00:23:24,010
and walking on the streets.

352
00:23:24,590 --> 00:23:26,920
We can even go watch the sunrise together.

353
00:23:28,550 --> 00:23:29,350
Susu,

354
00:23:30,550 --> 00:23:31,590
you did it.

355
00:23:48,350 --> 00:23:49,350
The Huo family has fallen!

356
00:23:49,350 --> 00:23:50,240
The Huo family is finished!

357
00:23:50,240 --> 00:23:51,550
The Huo family has fallen!

358
00:23:51,550 --> 00:23:53,080
The Huo family is finished!

359
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:54,790
The Huo family has fallen!

360
00:23:54,790 --> 00:23:56,160
The Huo family has fallen!

361
00:23:56,160 --> 00:23:57,620
The Huo family has fallen!

362
00:23:57,920 --> 00:23:59,510
The Huo family has fallen!

363
00:23:59,510 --> 00:24:01,030
The Huo family is finished!

364
00:24:01,030 --> 00:24:01,960
The Huo family has fallen!

365
00:24:01,960 --> 00:24:03,150
The Huo family is finished!

366
00:24:03,150 --> 00:24:04,240
The Huo family has fallen!

367
00:24:04,240 --> 00:24:05,770
The Huo family is finished!

368
00:24:34,880 --> 00:24:35,550
What now?

369
00:24:36,310 --> 00:24:37,680
Are you this determined

370
00:24:37,880 --> 00:24:39,410
to arrest me, Inspector Li?

371
00:24:42,440 --> 00:24:43,900
If you don't want to smile,

372
00:24:44,720 --> 00:24:46,580
you don't have to force yourself.

373
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:04,240
I just found out

374
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:07,060
what you've been doing all this time.

375
00:25:10,480 --> 00:25:11,680
It's really amazing.

376
00:25:16,510 --> 00:25:17,640
You've worked hard.

377
00:25:31,640 --> 00:25:33,960
The Huo family has no chance
to turn things around anymore.

378
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:35,560
The great matter is settled.

379
00:25:36,550 --> 00:25:37,610
What are your plans

380
00:25:38,070 --> 00:25:39,000
from now on?

381
00:25:47,510 --> 00:25:48,480
Do you plan to

382
00:25:49,270 --> 00:25:50,480
