392
00:26:33,270 --> 00:26:34,720
My parents died early.

393
00:26:36,480 --> 00:26:38,080
I only had a younger brother.

394
00:26:40,920 --> 00:26:43,380
We studied opera together since childhood.

395
00:26:44,790 --> 00:26:46,310
More than 10 years ago,

396
00:26:47,400 --> 00:26:48,960
