397
00:26:48,940 --> 00:26:50,860
[Nancheng Station]

398
00:26:59,000 --> 00:27:00,000
Wake up!

399
00:27:01,110 --> 00:27:02,400
Wake up!

400
00:27:02,960 --> 00:27:04,200
Xiaobao,

401
00:27:05,200 --> 00:27:06,590
