409
00:27:42,880 --> 00:27:43,680
It's nothing.

410
00:27:44,440 --> 00:27:45,400
It's just that

411
00:27:46,310 --> 00:27:47,590
this is the first time

412
00:27:50,310 --> 00:27:52,310
you've ever talked about your past.

413
00:27:54,590 --> 00:27:55,650
It's the first time

414
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:58,170
you've shed your disguise.

415
00:28:04,640 --> 00:28:06,040
When the weather is good,

416
00:28:06,590 --> 00:28:08,720
Inspector Li, would you do me the honor

417
00:28:09,200 --> 00:28:11,000
of joining me for a cup of coffee?

418
00:28:32,960 --> 00:28:34,690
Now that the Huo family is gone,

419
00:28:35,790 --> 00:28:37,880
I'm a bit at a loss.

420
00:28:39,240 --> 00:28:41,510
It feels like I have nothing to do now.

421
00:28:43,310 --> 00:28:45,270
All good things must come to an end.

422
00:28:46,000 --> 00:28:46,800
We should also

423
00:28:47,070 --> 00:28:48,440
go our own ways.

424
00:28:49,750 --> 00:28:52,550
I'm just a little reluctant
to part with all of you.

425
00:28:54,030 --> 00:28:55,160
After we part today,

426
00:28:55,200 --> 00:28:57,640
who knows when we'll reunite?

427
00:28:58,480 --> 00:29:00,140
We'll meet again eventually.

428
00:29:02,590 --> 00:29:03,350
But,

429
00:29:05,400 --> 00:29:07,070
since we are all sisters,

430
00:29:07,510 --> 00:29:08,970
shouldn't we do something

431
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:11,000
to commemorate this moment?

432
00:30:06,520 --> 00:30:12,370
[Three years ago, in Nanyang]

433
00:30:11,160 --> 00:30:11,880
Here.

434
00:30:48,960 --> 00:30:51,490
It's my fault
for failing to protect Xiaolan.

435
00:30:53,480 --> 00:30:55,110
I couldn't do anything.

436
00:30:55,990 --> 00:31:01,080
[Nanyang Pier]

437
00:30:56,590 --> 00:30:57,640
I could only

438
00:30:59,350 --> 00:31:01,080
hand you her remains like this.

439
00:31:22,440 --> 00:31:23,270
The Huo family

440
00:31:24,590 --> 00:31:25,990
has overwhelming power.

441
00:31:27,160 --> 00:31:28,590
The fact that you managed

442
00:31:29,510 --> 00:31:31,110
to bring Mulan back from them

443
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:34,260
is already quite an achievement.

444
00:31:35,310 --> 00:31:36,310
I...

445
00:31:37,590 --> 00:31:38,480
Thank you.

446
00:31:40,750 --> 00:31:41,510
-Uncle Fang...
-Thank you...

447
00:31:41,510 --> 00:31:42,310
Uncle Fang.

448
00:31:43,680 --> 00:31:44,640
Uncle Fang.

449
00:31:47,750 --> 00:31:50,080
I will definitely make the Huo family pay.

450
00:31:52,000 --> 00:31:52,720
Child...

451
00:31:55,200 --> 00:31:56,400
Leave the rest

452
00:31:57,680 --> 00:31:59,160
to me.

453
00:32:01,160 --> 00:32:02,290
You are still young.

454
00:32:03,160 --> 00:32:03,920
Since

455
00:32:04,550 --> 00:32:05,750
