456
00:32:05,750 --> 00:32:07,610
As long as the Huo family remains,

457
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:09,640
I will always live in misery.

458
00:32:11,000 --> 00:32:11,830
Uncle Fang,

459
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:13,750
this matter

460
00:32:14,720 --> 00:32:16,440
is not just for Xiaolan,

461
00:32:17,480 --> 00:32:18,880
but also for myself.

462
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:26,640
Good child,

463
00:32:28,680 --> 00:32:30,210
