478
00:33:40,720 --> 00:33:41,880
Why are you crying?

479
00:33:45,880 --> 00:33:47,010
I don't know either.

480
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:49,270
It feels like

481
00:33:50,880 --> 00:33:52,240
I've walked

482
00:33:53,070 --> 00:33:54,720
a long and dark road.

483
00:33:56,790 --> 00:33:58,450
Now that I've reached the end,

484
00:33:58,550 --> 00:33:59,440
I don't know...

485
00:33:59,510 --> 00:34:00,680
You don't know

486
00:34:02,160 --> 00:34:03,310
what to do after

487
00:34:03,830 --> 00:34:05,160
you've reached the end.

488
00:34:10,320 --> 00:34:11,850
That's just how people are.

489
00:34:12,630 --> 00:34:14,230
Those who are used to the dark

490
00:34:14,880 --> 00:34:16,340
will only find it blinding

491
00:34:16,670 --> 00:34:18,130
to suddenly see the light.

492
00:34:20,670 --> 00:34:22,550
It's like all of a sudden,

493
00:34:22,550 --> 00:34:24,409
they can't see anything clearly.

494
00:34:27,150 --> 00:34:27,880
Child,

495
00:34:29,030 --> 00:34:29,710
don't rush.

496
00:34:30,880 --> 00:34:32,280
From now on,

497
00:34:33,480 --> 00:34:34,070
you

498
00:34:35,510 --> 00:34:37,110
are no longer Fang Mulan.

499
00:34:39,150 --> 00:34:40,590
You can go back to being

500
00:34:42,070 --> 00:34:43,070
Ren Susu.

501
00:34:50,710 --> 00:34:52,110
But what should Ren Susu

502
00:34:53,960 --> 00:34:55,440
do?

503
00:34:59,190 --> 00:35:00,230
Why don't you

504
00:35:00,400 --> 00:35:01,260
ask your heart?

505
00:35:02,590 --> 00:35:04,960
A heart that belongs to Ren Susu.

506
00:35:07,360 --> 00:35:08,960
Where the heart wants to go,

507
00:35:10,030 --> 00:35:10,800
the body

508
00:35:11,480 --> 00:35:12,760
will take you there.

509
00:35:34,850 --> 00:35:36,750
♪ I happened to ♪

510
00:35:36,770 --> 00:35:38,840
