523
00:36:12,060 --> 00:36:14,480
♪ You are so clear ♪

524
00:36:14,560 --> 00:36:16,430
♪ So close and so clear ♪

525
00:36:16,190 --> 00:36:16,720
Let's go.

526
00:36:17,150 --> 00:36:18,110
I'll take you somewhere.

527
00:36:17,180 --> 00:36:19,400
♪ If you possibly ♪

528
00:36:19,540 --> 00:36:21,830
♪ Still have the courage ♪

529
00:36:21,850 --> 00:36:26,370
♪ Then take me away from here ♪

530
00:36:28,510 --> 00:36:30,650
♪ Please stop doubting ♪

531
00:36:30,720 --> 00:36:34,330
♪ My determination to run away with you ♪
